  "prompt": "Which stores made their first sale on or after 1 September 2024? Use the sales table. Return two columns, in this order: store_code and first_sale_date, the earliest order_date of the store. Return one row per store, and only the stores whose earliest order_date is 1 September 2024 or later, sorted by first_sale_date from latest to earliest.",
